{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》今（23日）假啟德體藝館隆重舉行，最終由尹景順（195分）奪得冠軍寶座，亞軍許雲妮（192分），季軍則是鄭家聲（190分）。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">節目尾聲播出彩蛋，見一眾評審肥媽、張佳添、周國豐、海兒在2027年的某月某日，齊齊收到「TVB 60」的訊息，最後齊聲說：「你哋都喺度」以及彈出「COMING SOON」的字眼，留下懸念。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"IG_VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791590’46”.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026vjE1Etki9a1787496586.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"IG_VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791590’46”.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"IG_VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791590’47”.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026oTUwMV8jwZ1787496604.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"IG_VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29791590’47”.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: